{"seq":37,"slug":"llm-app-eval-observability","title":"LLM 应用评测与可观测性","stage":"DONE","category":"ai-llm","categoryLabel":"AI / LLM","chapterCount":4,"docCount":12,"url":"/h/ai-llm/llm-app-eval-observability","rating":{"composite":3.72,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":3.8,"coverage":3.5,"positioning":3.5,"strategic":4},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":null},"introMarkdown":"评测与可观测性是 LLM 应用不退化的工程地基：把评测当 AI 的单元测试，用 golden 数据集与混合判定（确定性指标 + LLM-as-judge）做离线回归，用全链路追踪与三类指标仪表盘看清线上，再以漂移检测与失败样本挖掘形成持续改进的闭环。本 hub 面向要把 AI 应用从演示推向生产的工程师。\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"evaluation-foundations","title":"Evaluation Foundations","docCount":3,"url":"/h/ai-llm/llm-app-eval-observability/evaluation-foundations","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"why-evals-matter","title":"评测为何是 AI 应用的单元测试","url":"/h/ai-llm/llm-app-eval-observability/evaluation-foundations/why-evals-matter","wordCount":2404,"readingTime":10},{"seq":2,"slug":"golden-datasets","title":"Golden 数据集的构建与维护","url":"/h/ai-llm/llm-app-eval-observability/evaluation-foundations/golden-datasets","wordCount":2578,"readingTime":11},{"seq":3,"slug":"metrics-and-llm-judges","title":"确定性指标与 LLM-as-judge","url":"/h/ai-llm/llm-app-eval-observability/evaluation-foundations/metrics-and-llm-judges","wordCount":2618,"readingTime":11}],"introMarkdown":"评测是 AI 应用的单元测试：模型输出非确定、变更回归无处不在，「感觉变好了」无法支撑工程决策。本章先论证为什么评测体系必须从第一天建立，并给出单元级断言、数据集回归到线上监控的金字塔结构；接着讲 golden 数据集的来源优先级、覆盖设计、标注规范与版本化防泄漏机制；最后梳理确定性指标与 LLM-as-judge 的分工——精确项交给代码，判断类标准交给经过偏差校准的 judge。\n"},{"seq":2,"slug":"offline-evaluation","title":"Offline Evaluation","docCount":3,"url":"/h/ai-llm/llm-app-eval-observability/offline-evaluation","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"regression-pipelines","title":"回归评测流水线","url":"/h/ai-llm/llm-app-eval-observability/offline-evaluation/regression-pipelines","wordCount":2906,"readingTime":12},{"seq":2,"slug":"agent-trajectory-eval","title":"Agent 轨迹评测","url":"/h/ai-llm/llm-app-eval-observability/offline-evaluation/agent-trajectory-eval","wordCount":2983,"readingTime":12},{"seq":3,"slug":"ci-release-gates","title":"接入 CI 与发布门禁","url":"/h/ai-llm/llm-app-eval-observability/offline-evaluation/ci-release-gates","wordCount":2935,"readingTime":12}],"introMarkdown":"离线评测把「这次改动有没有让应用变差」从主观感受变成可重复运行的回归流水线。本章从评测流水线的标准结构讲起，覆盖环境固定与非确定性处理，再深入多轮 Agent 的轨迹评测——结果、轨迹与效率三个层面的度量方法。最后讨论如何把评测嵌进 CI 与发布门禁，让每一次 prompt、模型或检索配置的变更都自动接受检验。\n"},{"seq":3,"slug":"online-observability","title":"Online Observability","docCount":3,"url":"/h/ai-llm/llm-app-eval-observability/online-observability","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"tracing-instrumentation","title":"全链路追踪与埋点","url":"/h/ai-llm/llm-app-eval-observability/online-observability/tracing-instrumentation","wordCount":2529,"readingTime":11},{"seq":2,"slug":"cost-latency-quality-dashboards","title":"成本、延迟与质量仪表盘","url":"/h/ai-llm/llm-app-eval-observability/online-observability/cost-latency-quality-dashboards","wordCount":2456,"readingTime":10},{"seq":3,"slug":"drift-detection-alerting","title":"漂移检测与告警","url":"/h/ai-llm/llm-app-eval-observability/online-observability/drift-detection-alerting","wordCount":2571,"readingTime":11}],"introMarkdown":"评测不会随上线而结束，生产流量才是 LLM 应用最真实的考场。本章从全链路追踪与埋点入手，讲清一次请求在上下文组装、模型调用与工具执行之间留下的 span 树该如何记录与脱敏；继而把成本、延迟与质量三类指标组织成可下钻的仪表盘，支持按版本与分群对比；最后讨论漂移的来源、检测手段与告警降噪，以及确认漂移后的响应流程。\n"},{"seq":4,"slug":"feedback-loops","title":"Feedback Loops","docCount":3,"url":"/h/ai-llm/llm-app-eval-observability/feedback-loops","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"user-feedback-ingestion","title":"用户反馈的采集与摄入","url":"/h/ai-llm/llm-app-eval-observability/feedback-loops/user-feedback-ingestion","wordCount":2566,"readingTime":11},{"seq":2,"slug":"failure-mining","title":"失败样本挖掘","url":"/h/ai-llm/llm-app-eval-observability/feedback-loops/failure-mining","wordCount":2890,"readingTime":12},{"seq":3,"slug":"eval-driven-iteration","title":"评测驱动的迭代节奏","url":"/h/ai-llm/llm-app-eval-observability/feedback-loops/eval-driven-iteration","wordCount":2786,"readingTime":12}],"introMarkdown":"线上用户的每一次点赞、重试与放弃，都是评测体系最廉价也最真实的数据来源。这一章讲如何把显式与隐式反馈系统性地采集进可分析的管道，从线上轨迹中挖掘失败样本并归因分类，再把它们沉淀为 golden 集等评测资产。最终目标是建立一个评测驱动的迭代节奏：每一次改 prompt、调检索或换模型，都有离线回归与线上对比作为依据，而不是凭感觉拍板。\n"}]}